# Rust
# Workspace target dir (Block 33 cargo workspace; root Cargo.lock IS committed
# because the workspace contains a binary crate per goat-relay/Cargo.toml).
/target/
# Per-member target / lockfile leftovers (only the workspace-root Cargo.lock
# is authoritative; per-member Cargo.lock should not exist post-workspace).
goat-relay-protocol/target/
goat-relay-protocol/Cargo.lock
goat-relay/target/
goat-relay/Cargo.lock
zenoh-plugins/target/
zenoh-plugins/Cargo.lock
# Standalone trial-peer crates (each its own workspace; their Cargo.lock IS
# committed for --locked image builds, but local target/ never is).
ops/zenoh-trial-peers/*/target/
# Outbound federation republisher (its own workspace, same shape as the
# trial-peer crates; Cargo.lock IS committed for --locked image builds).
ops/federation/republisher/target/
# The consistency grading library + its meter (ops/consistency/rust/ is one
# workspace, so there is exactly one target/ and one Cargo.lock; the lock IS
# committed for --locked image builds).
ops/consistency/rust/target/
# CF-7 aggregator (consistency-foundation.md §7.8): the operator-local config
# and the per-goatnet client certs are laptop-only; the committed surface is
# aggregator.example.yaml + serve.sh.
ops/consistency/aggregator/aggregator.local.yaml
ops/consistency/aggregator/certs/
# Local TLS cert/key for ops/goat-relay/docker-compose.yml's `relay`
# service. Generated locally with openssl; never committed.
ops/goat-relay/tls/

