# SecArmy brief: dv-brief-export.html embeds radar.mp4 as base64 (~14 MB).
# Build artifact — regenerate via the export agent + inline base64 splice;
# never commit. The source deck + visual + dossier live alongside in git.

# Whitelist brief artifact distribution directory — these are intentionally
# committed (via LFS) so reviewers can read PDF/DOCX/PPTX without rebuilding.
# NATO-form data-access policy: the render-verified PDF is a deliverable
# (source of record is the .md beside it; regenerate on change).
# ZAGROS data-access explainer: the concrete companion, same treatment
# (source of record is the .html beside it; regenerate the PDF on change).
# Scale-1M implementation plan: rendered reading/sharing copy beside the .md
# (source of record is the .md; regenerate with render-scale-1m-plan.py on change).
# The rest of the data-sharing bundle: the complete access model, the
# grant-keyed-encryption deep-dive, and the federation-compliance criteria.
# Sources of record are the .html beside each; rebuild all with build-nato-bundle.sh.
# The signable release instrument: a template meant to be printed and signed,
# so the rendered copy is part of the deliverable. Built by build-nato-bundle.sh.
!docs/partner-templates/release-declaration-and-accession.pdf
# ...but never the Office lock files Word/PowerPoint create while the
# committed artifacts are open for inspection.

# compiled helper binaries from ops/goat-id-console/tools/ (go build drops them here)
ops/goat-id-console/reissue-preview

# goat gym — rendered at deploy time, never committed
ops/gym/site/

# Compiled binaries `go build ./...` drops next to their module. The module name
# equals the directory name, so the artifact is invisible in a status listing
# full of source files — which is how three were swept into a commit by
# `git add -A` during the 2026-08-18 module-path rewrite, and two more during
# the F-361 CVE remediation the same day. Both sets had to be removed before
# their PRs.
ops/admit-audit/admit-audit
ops/mgmt-host-bootstrap/mgmt-host-bootstrap
ops/signal-federation-probe/signal-federation-probe
ops/smoketest/smoketest
ops/wave3/soak-gen/soak-gen

# goat Skills Handbook: the rendered PDF is a committed deliverable (LFS),
