!docs/design/goat-skills-handbook.pdf

# cold-start markers (ADR 1190): per machine, consumed by the next session
.claude/coldstart.md
.claude/coldstart.consumed/

# Near-secret opsec values — equipment MAC addresses and host/mesh/LAN IPs.
# Per ADR 1196: these may live in plaintext ONLY in gitignored local files
# (or as op:// references), never in a tracked file. The CI/pre-commit guard
# ops/ci/check-no-identity-spillage.sh enforces this. *.local.md / .yaml / .txt
# are the sanctioned local home (e.g. docs/reference/*-inventory.local.md).
*.local.md
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml
*.local.txt

# ops/oss: the derived dictionary concentrates every mesh address, host and operator e-mail
# in one file; it is rebuilt at export time from the committed seed, never committed (ADR 1215)
ops/oss/substitutions.yaml
